```
https://t1.meetflowai.site/dl/VPNFlow-Setup-1.4.5.exe?v=d6db58cb -> HTTP/2 200, content-length 52789954
https://t1.meetflowai.site/buy                                   -> HTTP 200 (có link ?v=d6db58cb)
```

